# Collatz steps — count how many steps n takes to reach 1 under the famous
# 3n+1 rule (halve when even, triple-and-add-one when odd).
#
# The While loop threads a [value, steps] pair; evenness is n/2*2 = n.
#
#   domain challenges/04_collatz.domain
Cursed Energy: 04_collatz.input
Cursed Technique: Apply
    Using: (s) -> list(toint(s), 0)
Simple Domain: While
    Using: (st) -> first(st) > 1
    Cursed Technique: Apply
        Using: (st) -> list(if first(st) / 2 * 2 = first(st) then first(st) / 2 else 3 * first(st) + 1, last(st) + 1)
Cursed Technique: Apply
    Using: (st) -> last(st)
Reveal: stdout
